OL,3,GNEWSAReview sought into 'nightmare'    
OL,4,AAlderney air links                     
OL,6,FA politician has called for an urgent  
OL,7,Freview into Alderney's air links after 
OL,8,Fa number of flights were cancelled over
OL,9,Fthe weekend.                           
OL,11,FAlderney States member Alex Snowdon has
OL,12,Fsubmitted a letter to Guernsey's       
OL,13,FScrutiny Management Committee to raise 
OL,14,Fhis concerns, describing the current   
OL,15,Fstate of services as "a nightmare".    
OL,17,FHis comments follow ones raised by     
OL,18,FSteve Roberts, when he said the        
OL,19,Finconsistency of flights to and from   
OL,20,Fthe island could present a "very real" 
OL,21,Frisk to life if hospital appointments  
OL,22,Fwere missed.                           
