OL,3,GNEWSAReview sought into 'nightmare'    
OL,4,AAlderney air links                     
OL,6,FAurigny said this weekend's            
OL,7,Fcancellations were due to a mixture of 
OL,8,Ftechnical and weather-related issues,  
OL,9,Fbut added services had "fallen well    
OL,10,Fshort of expectations in recent        
OL,11,Fmonths".                               
